# Play test of Signal Rock (CIPlay signal_rock, in a test world 'CI ...'): the island played as a player would.
# Points are metres from the island's land middle, as in its recipe. The station's frame is at (-11,-11) turned 45:
# a point (x, z) of the station is (-11 + 0.707 (x + z), -11 + 0.707 (z - x)).
island Signal Rock
expect step 0
expect title Dead Air

# Getting on: the ladder from the water at the deck's front, the walkway from the ridge's southern arm onto deck B
climb -12.41 -16.66 h=0.3
walk 0.8 -20.0 to -3.93 -15.24 to -7.46 -13.12
expect stand -8.88 -13.12 h=2.5
zone deck
expect step 1
expect message radio room door

# Into the radio room through its door: the operator's log
walk -8.88 -13.12 to -11 -11 to -13.12 -8.88
expect stand -13.12 -8.88 h=2.5 below=4
read Operator's log
expect step 2

# The transmitter without its coil
use radioDead
expect message coil socket is empty
expect hidden printout
expect hidden beaconswitch

# The puffer fish round the coil's crate on the cove floor
kill Puffer fish
expect step 3
expect animals Puffer fish 0

# The coil's crate on the cove floor
openat -15 -14.5
expect story coil 1
expect step 4

# Fitted: the transmitter works, the printout appears
use radioDead
expect message transmitter hums
expect story coil 0
expect shown printout
expect shown radioLive
expect hidden radioDead
expect shown beaconswitch
use radioLive
expect message Follow the beacons east
read Signal printout
expect step 5

# Up the stair to the roof, up the mast ladder to the platform
walk -2.87 -14.18 to -4.46 -12.24 to -8.88 -7.82 to -13.12 -8.88
expect stand -13.12 -8.88 h=5.5
climb -12.27 -8.03 h=5.6
expect stand -11.07 -6.83 h=24.5

# The mast top wakes the screechers; the switch lights the beacon and ends the quest
zone masttop
expect message Screechers lift off
zone beaconswitch
expect shown beacon
expect done
expect item HeadLight 1
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
